  "invariant": "A recorded response cannot be treated as the outcome of an input that follows it in native order and timestamp, even when the native turn IDs agree.",
  "root_cause": {
    "source": "capture-native-projection.py",
    "function": "project_rows",
    "finding": "All selected finals for a native turn are assigned to every user item in that turn, without checking whether the reply follows that input. A reused turn ID therefore carries an earlier outcome into a later input.",
    "proposed_change": "Select replies strictly after each input before choosing explicit finals or last-commentary fallback; preserve excluded preceding reply references and existing shared-turn uncertainty."
